    icon: '🛂',
    title: 'Entry & Visas',
    items: [
      'Transit visa-free 144h',
      'Keep a digital and physical copy of your passport, visa, and travel insurance at all times',
      'Entry fees for Great Wall should be paid in CNY — exchange money before arriving',
    ],
  },
  {
    icon: '💉',
    title: 'Health & Safety',
    items: [
